### How to test this:
1. Push all 3 updates to GitHub.
2. Open your live app.
3. Notice the new **Enable Notifications** button in the sidebar menu. If the bell ever hides unexpectedly, you (or existing users) can click this button.
4. Click the Bell (or the sidebar button). 
5. Because I added visible popups (`showToast`) to every single step, **watch your screen carefully.**
6. It will print "Step 1", then "Step 2", then "Step 3", and finally "SUCCESS!".

If it stops at any step, the red toast will tell you *exactly* what the error is on your screen. Let me know what step it prints!
